<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Electric, 8-month group results.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Electric, 8-month group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		     8-month			 full-year</p>
<p> Sales		152.29		vs	  254.87</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.20		vs    prft 12.43</p>
<p> Current	 loss 2.69		vs    prft 12.45</p>
<p> Net	     loss 3.37		vs     prft 5.38</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 65.09 yen	  vs   prft 104.13 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd makes electronic parts, especially system components.</p>
